# The 3-D panel from the tools' bar; clip: the surface cut at the probe line, the gizmo on the cut. The red arrow
# dragged: the cut moves along x and the body shows again. Turn: rings; the blue ring dragged turns the cut about the
# vertical. A click on the view cube's top face: the camera looks down on the plate and its slanted cut
